# Cloudflare Pages response headers for bluegrasscube.jaredluyster.com
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Cloudflare Pages applies a 24h edge+browser cache to static assets (css/js/images)
# by default, and does not purge it on redeploy. That's fine for a stable site, but
# actively fights this project while it's still being built phase-by-phase — a push
# can go live in index.html while board.css keeps serving an edge-cached copy from
# hours earlier. Force immediate revalidation on every request until the site
# stabilizes post-Phase-7, then revisit for longer caching if desired.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
